# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile
@host = http://localhost:5000

### Create a response
POST {{host}}/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "What is the weather in Tokyo?"
}

### Create a streaming response
POST {{host}}/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "What is the weather in Tokyo?",
  "stream": true
}
